OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1789159784
OL,3,CPrince William's launches toolkit for
OL,4,Csuicide prevention through sport
OL,6,FThe Prince of Wales is today launching
OL,7,Fa new initiative in a bid to "harness
OL,8,Fthe power of sport to prevent suicide".
OL,10,FPrince William is bringing together
OL,11,Fsporting stars and leaders from major
OL,12,Forganisations to launch 'On Your
OL,13,FSide', a toolkit designed to help spot
OL,14,Fwarning signs, start conversations and
OL,15,Fconnect individuals with support.
OL,17,FIt combines the Prince's longstanding
OL,18,Fcommitment to mental health support
OL,19,Fand suicide prevention with his
OL,20,Fpassion for sport and belief in its
OL,21,Fability to bring people together.
OL,26,@oD@^OUpD@fO]
