PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1789159784
OL,3,CPrince William's launches toolkit for
OL,4,Csuicide prevention through sport
OL,6,FIn a written foreword to the toolkit,
OL,7,FWilliam says: "At every level, sport
OL,8,Fhas a remarkable ability to bring
OL,9,Fpeople together, creating communities
OL,10,Fup and down the country which foster a
OL,11,Fspirit of healthy competition, a
OL,12,Fshared sense of purpose, and a culture
OL,13,Fof belonging.
OL,15,F"Sport can also provide vital
OL,16,Fconnection and support at times when
OL,17,Fpeople need it most - times when
OL,18,Fthey're feeling pressure, loss or even
OL,19,Fdespair.
OL,26,@oD@OOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1789159784
OL,3,CPrince William's launches toolkit for
OL,4,Csuicide prevention through sport
OL,6,F"Through my work on mental health, I
OL,7,Fhave met people whose lives have been
OL,8,Fchanged forever by suicide.
OL,10,F"But I have also met people whose
OL,11,Flives have been saved because someone
OL,12,Fstepped in to help. Each of their
OL,13,Fexperiences has had a profound impact
OL,14,Fon me.
OL,16,F"In moments of need, the right support
OL,17,Fcan make all the difference. We all
OL,18,Fhave the power to help, and that's why
OL,19,Fsuicide prevention must be an
OL,20,Fimportant part of everyday sporting
OL,21,Flife."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUxD@AOU}D@FO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/9
