PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1789159784
OL,3,CPrince William's launches toolkit for
OL,4,Csuicide prevention through sport
OL,6,FWillliam is set to be joined at the
OL,7,Fhome of Everton Football Club ` the
OL,8,FHill Dickinson Stadium in Liverpool `
OL,9,Fby Dame Kelly Holmes, Gabby Logan,
OL,10,FJill Scott, Sir Jason and Dame Laura
OL,11,FKenny, and other leading figures from
OL,12,Facross sport to launch the new toolkit
OL,13,Fon World Suicide Prevention Day.
OL,15,FHazel Detsiny, Executive Director of
OL,16,FThe Royal Foundation, said: "The scale
OL,17,Fof the challenge is clear. Suicide
OL,18,Fremains one of the most serious public
OL,19,Fhealth issues we face with over 7,000
OL,20,Fdeaths a year across the UK.
OL,26,@xD@]OU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1789159784
OL,3,CPrince William's launches toolkit for
OL,4,Csuicide prevention through sport
OL,6,F"It's the biggest cause of death of
OL,7,Fmen under 50. The picture across the
OL,8,Ffour nations shows the same pattern
OL,9,Fwith men being disproportionately
OL,10,Faffected.
OL,12,F"Sport has an unparalleled reach and
OL,13,Finfluence with this group that few
OL,14,Fother sectors can match."
OL,16,FTo mark the launch, The Royal
OL,17,FFoundation has produced a short film
OL,18,Faimed at encouraging people to have
OL,19,Fthe confidence to start a conversation
OL,20,Fabout suicide.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUvD@YO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/9
