OL,3,CPrince William's launches toolkit for
OL,4,Csuicide prevention through sport
OL,6,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FIn a speech, William is expected to
OL,12,Fsay: "My hope is that every sporting
OL,13,Forganisation in the country will look
OL,14,Fat what is being launched today and
OL,15,Fask a question: 'What more can we do?'
OL,16,FBecause the opportunity before us is
OL,17,Fenormous.'"
OL,26,@tD@FOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/9
