CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1789159784
OL,3,CPrince William's launches toolkit for
OL,4,Csuicide prevention through sport
OL,6,FHe will add: "Sport has the ability to
OL,7,Freach people who may never walk
OL,8,Fthrough the door of a mental
OL,9,Fhealthcare service. People who may
OL,10,Fnever seek support themselves and may
OL,11,Fbe struggling in silence.
OL,13,F"The sporting community can help
OL,14,Fchange that."
OL,16,FThe Football Association, of which the
OL,17,FPrince is patron, will commit to
OL,18,Fembedding the toolkit across its
OL,19,Fentire organisation, as well as its
OL,20,Fcommunity and grassroots football
OL,21,Fnetwork.
OL,26,@vD@MO]
